# Dutiful Griffin {3}{W}{W}, a 4/4 flyer: "{2}{W}, Sacrifice two enchantments: Return this card from your graveyard to your
# hand." Bot1 casts it on turn one, and Bot2 kills it with Terror on turn two. On turn three Bot1 puts two Pacifisms on Bot2's
# Ornithopter, and on turn five pays {2}{W} and sacrifices both: the Griffin goes back to Bot1's hand and both Pacifisms to the
# graveyard (CR 118.3, 701.21a), so the Ornithopter is free again.

